+
+**This verdict names the dispatch the card will name.** I copied the id from the ledger rather than
+guessing: `disp-bouEIM-49hK0xR_-B8EMm` is an **implementation** dispatch from Aegis, status `done`,
+and **no acceptance card and no verdict currently name it**. It is the dispatch whose work this commit
